tronic attachment) https://holoeyes.jp/pmda/", "short_description": "The medical imaging software \"Holoeyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1kfgZiGpK6YQ7kNvwET6fU-&_nc_oc=AdqLaRAP4CoTGd0NsFXdCJN_kJuupVa07MUjA9HwSg6kK1wzYPJVL6jP7qKpzAC9PE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1G1ey8S1clas9vUclS64L3wid_z9F45VvdWWIPf-5k8Q&oe=69F1F8CD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z9RhQ_0QSrgQ7kNvwG4QY5i&_nc_oc=AdryoR_WrkhtHiEI6xEuBnAOpfnWtHMvwuD4enXkShkQrVSpK0q0JSoRD10Ut4S10ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af16bDYlh6Xqs_ToxegLtK-fueuisPE_grSAaU-eZa2qww&oe=69F1EB2C"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L-ikJBBIPFYQ7kNvwFZtIDz&_nc_oc=AdqhxTwtWnXnodE5yFuJX7LZsZCn_ks1tc6dtvSL8wG3Fc5TsRAUoxp4bCtj-tgqr10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2zjbfsOhJCSNsjNToLhGKS4t0aCMTZHwInqsiDti3XUQ&oe=69F20CBD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t6